{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109875","id":2766781794,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6k6b1i","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109875","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109875.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109875.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109875","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109875/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109875/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109875/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/860be30cc03f8fd5601e956279003a8ac290fbb3","number":109875,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implementation of the Wayland Layer Shell Protocol","user":{"login":"MoutonDemocrate","id":85873312,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODczMzEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85873312?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate","html_url":"https://github.com/MoutonDemocrate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoutonDemocrate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"⚠️ I've implemented this over the weekend and this is my first time contributing to the Godot Project. I might have messed up a few things, and it's okay to tell me ! ⚠️\r\n⚠️ It's also my first time implementing the layer shell protocol, and modifying the Godot engine, so my code may not be up to standards ! ⚠️\r\n\r\nThis implements what was proposed in godot proposals, [issue 11351 : Implementation/Workaround for Wayland Layer Shell Protocol Overlay](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11351)\r\n\r\nThis code allows Wayland windows to be...\r\n- Background windows, displayed on the same level as the wallpaper.\r\n- Bottom windows, displayed behind all others.\r\n- Top windows, displayed above other windows and reserving space (like a bar, for example)\r\n- Overlay windows, displayed on top of everything else, and regardless of the workspace (like a notification window)\r\n\r\n- Added a property for the `Window` class to control the layer of the window on Wayland.\r\n- Added a project setting for the layer of the main window.\r\n\r\nHere's a test project I made with an overlay window to display the lyrics of my currently played song using `sptlrx`\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b969d921-84ba-4f2e-b92e-43be5734f657","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"arch